pc:subject_community_affairs a skos:Concept ; skos:prefLabel "Community affairs"@en ; skos:definition "Local and regional communal life."@en ; rdfs:comment "A local subject concept supplies a topic value; the pinned ontologies provide subject relations but no matching controlled topic identifier." .
pc:subject_zionism a skos:Concept ; skos:prefLabel "Zionism"@en ; skos:definition "Zionist activity, institutions and campaigns."@en ; rdfs:comment "A local subject concept supplies a topic value; the pinned ontologies provide subject relations but no matching controlled topic identifier." .
pc:subject_international_affairs a skos:Concept ; skos:prefLabel "International affairs"@en ; skos:definition "News of the wider world."@en ; rdfs:comment "A local subject concept supplies a topic value; the pinned ontologies provide subject relations but no matching controlled topic identifier." .
pc:title_type_printed a skos:Concept, rico:TitleType ; skos:prefLabel "Printed title"@en ; skos:definition "The printed words naming a content item or a section."@en ; rdfs:comment "Distinguishes words printed in the source from a supplied name; RiC-O defines TitleType but not this controlled value." .
pc:title_type_supplied a skos:Concept, rico:TitleType ; skos:prefLabel "Supplied title"@en ; skos:definition "An attributed English name pinned to the text it was made from."@en ; rdfs:comment "Distinguishes an attributed English name from printed words; RiC-O defines TitleType but not this controlled value." .
pc:site_printed_address a owl:NamedIndividual ; rdfs:comment "The picture key, pixel box and printed words locate evidence independently of changing content item numbers." .
pc:site_text_basis a owl:NamedIndividual ; rdfs:comment "Exact source text and printed addresses preserve the basis of a translation or supplied title, including after a rereading." .
pc:site_translation a owl:NamedIndividual ; rdfs:comment "Attributed English text pinned to its source text is semantic work; the pinned ontologies have no exact translation-and-text-basis term." .
pc:site_authorship a owl:NamedIndividual ; rdfs:comment "Records whether a person or a model wrote a supplied title or translation, reusing production attribution." .
pc:site_mention a owl:NamedIndividual ; rdfs:comment "A printed occurrence joins a shared person to a content item with roles; a mention alone does not assert that the person is its subject." .
pc:site_shared_record a owl:NamedIndividual ; rdfs:comment "One storage document joins the production sourced facts, sources and identities across issues." .
pc:site_fact_subject a owl:NamedIndividual ; rdfs:comment "Identifies whose statement a production fact is, including a family or relation." .
pc:site_fact_representation a owl:NamedIndividual ; rdfs:comment "Distinguishes structured facts, prose and image paths without approving their publication." .
pc:site_standing a owl:NamedIndividual ; rdfs:comment "Proposed is accepted plus pending review; accepted is accepted plus approved review; doubted is disputed; rejected is rejected. Attribution and review retain who said so." .
pc:site_site_copy a owl:NamedIndividual ; rdfs:comment "Full text, block breaks and block references are copies for the site, rebuilt from the physical source." .
pc:site_site_documents a owl:NamedIndividual ; rdfs:comment "Groups the four issue documents for reference validation without copying shared persons into them." .
